# LINE ENDINGS - owner decision 2026-11-14. Read LINE_ENDINGS.md. Enforced by tools/check-eol.mjs (node tools/check-eol.mjs, the pre-commit hook).
# git STORES LF always; the WORKING copy follows these rules: VBA source and Windows batch files CRLF, everything else LF.
# A file type that is not listed gets the default (LF). A new kind of file that must differ is added HERE, never fixed by hand.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bas text eol=crlf
*.cls text eol=crlf
*.frm text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.docm binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pyc binary
# Reports and exports that VBA (or another tool) writes in its own style: the working copy is not checked (the index still must hold LF).
rpt/** eol-exempt

